erred." (at 12 340 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "1fc261f1-108f-4fd9-ac70-6984724a0e3f")) (text "DRDY PA0/PA1: timestamp and schedule both 27-byte ADC reads. Shared START/CLK; independent chip selects." (at 12 350 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3edc08d4-e006-46ac-9dfc-7ab4fcc11601")) (text "FIRMWARE REQUIRED: SPI DMA; cache-coherent bounded SRAM ring; sequence + timestamp + CRC32 frames; overflow counters." (at 12 360 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "d2a7771b-d671-435b-8d24-b9b8a1785e7a")) (text "FIRMWARE REQUIRED: notch/filter/decimation/FFT/features; artifact flags; calibrated classifier/inference interface." (at 12 370 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b90560c3-9c7f-4f2f-818a-221f1a789fe2")) (text "Enable IWDG and brownout reset; keep START low, PWDN low and module enable low until rails and clocks are verified." (at 12 380 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3679cea7-e84b-4ab6-81ab-26077703dfca")) (text "RTC/LSE gives timebase; timer capture gives sample timing. Hardware alone does not implement DSP, ML or safe control." (at 12 390 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "68e98145-0175-4de9-bff9-9ad034a9c1c5")))